证明：
\[
f(t')=Ee^{it'\xi}
=\sum_{k=0}^{\infty} e^{it'k}
\frac{\binom{M}{k}\binom{N-M}{n-k}}{\binom{N}{n}}.
\]
将前几项展开，有
\[
\begin{aligned}
f(t')
&=\frac{(N-M)(N-M-1)\cdots(N-M-n+1)n!}
{N(N-1)\cdots(N-n+1)n!\,0!}e^{it'\cdot0}\\
&\quad+\frac{(N-M)(N-M-1)\cdots(N-M-n+2)n!M}
{N(N-1)\cdots(N-n+1)(n-1)!\,1!}e^{it'\cdot1}\\
&\quad+\frac{(N-M)(N-M-1)\cdots(N-M-n+3)n!M(M-1)}
{N(N-1)\cdots(N-n+1)(n-2)!\,2!}e^{it'\cdot2}\\
&\quad+\frac{(N-M)(N-M-1)\cdots(N-M-n+4)n!M(M-1)(M-2)}
{N(N-1)\cdots(N-n+1)(n-3)!\,3!}e^{it'\cdot3}+\cdots .
\end{aligned}
\]
提取公共因子，得
\[
\begin{aligned}
f(t')
&=\frac{(N-M)(N-M-1)\cdots(N-M-n+1)}
{N(N-1)\cdots(N-n+1)}\\
&\quad\cdot\left\{
1+\frac{(-n)(-M)}{N-M-n+1}e^{it'}
+\frac{(-n)(-n+1)(-M)(-M+1)}
{(N-M-n+1)(N-M-n+2)}\frac{e^{2it'}}{2!}
+\cdots\right\}\\
&=\frac{(N-M)(N-M-1)\cdots(N-M-n+1)}
{N(N-1)\cdots(N-n+1)}
F(-n,-M,N-M-n+1,e^{it'}).
\end{aligned}
\]
令
\[
-n=\alpha,\qquad -M=\beta,\qquad N-M-n+1=\gamma,\qquad e^{it'}=t,
\]
则
\[
F(-n,-M,N-M-n+1,e^{it'})
=F(\alpha,\beta,\gamma,t)
=1+\frac{\alpha\beta}{\gamma}t+
\frac{\alpha(\alpha+1)\beta(\beta+1)}{\gamma(\gamma+1)}\frac{t^2}{2!}+\cdots .
\]
于是将 \(t'\) 改记为 \(t\)，即得
\[
f(t)=\frac{(N-M)(N-M-1)\cdots(N-M-n+1)}
{N(N-1)\cdots(N-n+1)}
F(-n,-M,N-M-n+1,e^{it}).
\]

